    "question": {
      ":question/id": "a17f468e-164d-5c11-9ef2-1cb38f3e16c6",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\csc x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The point $(\\frac{-9\\pi }{2},-1)$ is on the graph.\n- **II.** $x=8\\pi $ is a vertical asymptote.\n- **III.** $x=\\frac{-4\\pi }{2}$ is in the domain.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "b0b5d391-b0ff-541c-bea8-ccda79362f42",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "de30a8a4-71d3-5567-8aa2-e19f8a352189",
