    "question": {
      ":question/id": "439ac77f-b89b-5504-9553-4e99f2516143",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\csc x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The point $(\\frac{9\\pi }{2},1)$ is on the graph.\n- **II.** $x=-8\\pi $ is a vertical asymptote.\n- **III.** $x=\\frac{-10\\pi }{2}$ is in the domain.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "27937c81-9661-5c73-8135-a9dd179f0368",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
