      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\csc x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The point $(\\frac{5\\pi }{2},1)$ is on the graph.\n- **II.** $x=3\\pi $ is a vertical asymptote.\n- **III.** $x=\\frac{-7\\pi }{2}$ is in the domain.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "e9f00980-f2ac-53c3-a9f2-0ce7f5dc68ea",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
